<button id="rayBtn2" onclick="selectRay(2)" style="text-align:left;border-left:6px solid #e02b2b">2 · in through F → out parallel</button>
<button id="rayBtn3" onclick="selectRay(3)" style="text-align:left;border-left:6px solid #8064b0">3 · along radius through C → retraces</button>
